        "@value": "Group status: New\nAGS 4.1: Group Added - Replaces IPRG and IPRT\nAGS 4.1: Headings Added - LOCA_ID, FGHG_TOP, FGHG_BASE, FGHG_TESN, FGHI_INST, FGHI_TYPE, FGHI_DETL, FGHI_LOCT, FGHI_REM, FILE_FSET"
